codex
The Corollary F finding needs a qualification: the omitted \(X/P\) term is essential for a bound on an individual support type, but it can be absorbed if the sum includes every allowed type. I also found a concrete gap in the QS code claim: on a Blum semiprime, its sieve filter discards the smooth value \(Q(x)=2^{30}\). H1 must count retained relations, or the scan must test all values.
apply patch
